window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a456-4e6749917335792b.json"]={sha256:"4e6749917335792b0820a863fff0544146e4f2511d28dc30f75147fd083b1779",value:{"id":"a456","title":"同步輻射儲存環","titleEn":"Synchrotron storage rings","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以一座 3 GeV、528 m 的教學用多彎消色散儲存環為主線，從同步輻射造成的每圈 430 keV 能量損失出發，說明發射度為何隨彎轉角三次方下降，再把小孔徑磁鐵、射頻補能、束流尺寸量測、Touschek 壽命、插件磁鐵擾動與頂注驗收整合成可交接的光源工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Follow a 3 GeV, 528 m teaching multi-bend-achromat storage ring from the 430 keV per-turn energy loss caused by synchrotron radiation, see why emittance falls with the cube of the bending angle, then integrate small-bore magnets, RF energy replacement, beam-size measurement, Touschek lifetime, insertion-device perturbations and top-up acceptance into a transferable light-source engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-accelerators-detectors","subcategoryTitle":"加速器、光束線與粒子偵測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Accelerators, beamlines and particle detectors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-accelerators-detectors","learningTags":["optics","optics-accelerators-detectors","accelerator"],"architectureFamily":"accelerator","architectureNodes":[["直線加速器與增能環","Linac and booster"],["注入踢波與頂注","Injection kickers and top-up"],["MBA 磁鐵晶格","MBA magnet lattice"],["射頻腔與諧波腔","RF and harmonic cavities"],["插件磁鐵","Insertion devices"],["光束線前端","Beamline front ends"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[3,2],[2,4],[4,5],[4,3]],"diagram":{"type":"accelerator","labels":["直線加速器與增能環","注入踢波與頂注","MBA 磁鐵晶格","射頻腔與諧波腔","插件磁鐵"],"labelsEn":["Linac and booster","Injection kickers and top-up","MBA magnet lattice","RF and harmonic cavities","Insertion devices"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"晶格升級練習：同一條 528 m、3 GeV 的隧道，比較 24 晶胞 DBA（48 片彎轉磁鐵，每片 1.4 m）與 20 晶胞 7BA（140 片，總彎轉長度 104.8 m）。DBA：ρ = 48×1.4/(2π) ≈ 10.7 m、B ≈ 0.94 T、U₀ = 88.5×81/10.7 ≈ 670 keV、εc ≈ 5.6 keV、τ_x = 2E·T₀/U₀ ≈ 15.8 ms，TME 極限 637 pm。7BA：ρ = 16.7 m、B = 0.6 T、U₀ ≈ 430 keV、εc ≈ 3.59 keV、τ_x ≈ 24.6 ms，TME 極限 25.7 pm。500 mA 下彎轉磁鐵輻射功率從 335 kW 降到 215 kW，射頻負擔減輕，但阻尼變慢、εc 變低，硬 X 光改由插件磁鐵提供。若兩者實際發射度都約為 TME 的 4 倍（2.55 nm 對 103 pm），垂直發射度相同，則加上 1 Å 光子的 8 pm 後，水平有效光源發射度從 2.56 nm 降到 111 pm，波盪器亮度約提高 23 倍。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際設施規格。","textEn":"Lattice upgrade exercise: in the same 528 m, 3 GeV tunnel compare a 24-cell DBA (48 dipoles of 1.4 m) with a 20-cell 7BA (140 dipoles, 104.8 m of total bending length). DBA: ρ = 48×1.4/(2π) ≈ 10.7 m, B ≈ 0.94 T, U0 = 88.5×81/10.7 ≈ 670 keV, εc ≈ 5.6 keV, τ_x = 2E·T0/U0 ≈ 15.8 ms and a TME limit of 637 pm. 7BA: ρ = 16.7 m, B = 0.6 T, U0 ≈ 430 keV, εc ≈ 3.59 keV, τ_x ≈ 24.6 ms and a TME limit of 25.7 pm. At 500 mA the dipole radiation power falls from 335 kW to 215 kW, easing the RF load, but damping slows and εc drops, so hard X-rays must come from insertion devices. If both lattices reach about 4 times their TME limit (2.55 nm versus 103 pm) with equal vertical emittance, adding the 8 pm photon term at 1 Å gives a horizontal effective source emittance falling from 2.56 nm to 111 pm, raising undulator brightness about 23-fold. Values are teaching assumptions, not any facility's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a456-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量」與「發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy\" and \"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a456-v12-01","title":"同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「彎轉磁鐵與輻射光錐」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Bending magnet and radiation cone” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"儲存環讓數 GeV 的電子在磁場中持續偏轉，相對論電子偏轉時沿切線方向放出張角約 1/γ 的同步輻射光錐，每一圈損失的能量 U₀ 必須由射頻腔補回。U₀ 與 E⁴/ρ 成正比，這是電子而非質子適合當光源的原因；輻射頻譜以臨界能量 εc 描述，一半功率在 εc 以上、一半在以下。輻射同時是阻尼機制：能量沿動量方向損失、射頻只在縱向補回，使振盪逐漸衰減，並與量子激發的隨機擾動達成平衡，決定環的平衡發射度與能量散佈。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「彎轉磁鐵與輻射光錐」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A storage ring keeps electrons of several GeV bending in magnetic fields, and relativistic electrons emit synchrotron radiation tangentially in a cone of opening about 1/γ; the energy U0 lost each turn must be restored by RF cavities. U0 scales as E⁴/ρ, which is why electrons rather than protons make light sources, and the spectrum is described by the critical energy εc, with half the power above it and half below. Radiation is also a damping mechanism: energy is lost along the momentum direction but replaced by RF only longitudinally, so oscillations decay until balanced by the random kicks of quantum excitation, which sets the ring's equilibrium emittance and energy spread. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Bending magnet and radiation cone”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：E = 3 GeV、彎轉場 B = 0.6 T：ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m，U₀ = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV，500 mA 時輻射功率 U₀·I ≈ 215 kW；εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For E = 3 GeV and a bending field B = 0.6 T, ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m and U0 = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV, so at 500 mA the radiated power U0·I ≈ 215 kW; εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV.","failure":"常見誤解：「儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「彎轉磁鐵與輻射光錐」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Bending magnet and radiation cone”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-01-k1","title":"同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量","titleEn":"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy","text":"儲存環讓數 GeV 的電子在磁場中持續偏轉，相對論電子偏轉時沿切線方向放出張角約 1/γ 的同步輻射光錐，每一圈損失的能量 U₀ 必須由射頻腔補回。U₀ 與 E⁴/ρ 成正比，這是電子而非質子適合當光源的原因；輻射頻譜以臨界能量 εc 描述，一半功率在 εc 以上、一半在以下。","textEn":"A storage ring keeps electrons of several GeV bending in magnetic fields, and relativistic electrons emit synchrotron radiation tangentially in a cone of opening about 1/γ; the energy U0 lost each turn must be restored by RF cavities. U0 scales as E⁴/ρ, which is why electrons rather than protons make light sources, and the spectrum is described by the critical energy εc, with half the power above it and half below.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy\" is correct?","options":["儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。","儲存環讓數 GeV 的電子在磁場中持續偏轉，相對論電子偏轉時沿切線方向放出張角約 1/γ 的同步輻射光錐，每一圈損失的能量 U₀ 必須由射頻腔補回。","只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。"],"optionsEn":["Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.","A storage ring keeps electrons of several GeV bending in magnetic fields, and relativistic electrons emit synchrotron radiation tangentially in a cone of opening about 1/γ.","Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"儲存環讓數 GeV 的電子在磁場中持續偏轉，相對論電子偏轉時沿切線方向放出張角約 1/γ 的同步輻射光錐，每一圈損失的能量 U₀ 必須由射頻腔補回。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A storage ring keeps electrons of several GeV bending in magnetic fields, and relativistic electrons emit synchrotron radiation tangentially in a cone of opening about 1/γ; the energy U0 lost each turn must be restored by RF cavities. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a456-v12-02","title":"同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量：定量估算","titleEn":"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「彎轉磁鐵與輻射光錐」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Bending magnet and radiation cone” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：E = 3 GeV、彎轉場 B = 0.6 T：ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m，U₀ = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV，500 mA 時輻射功率 U₀·I ≈ 215 kW；εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV。周長 528 m、迴轉週期 T₀ = 1.76 µs，阻尼時間 τ = 2E·T₀/(J·U₀)：縱向（J ≈ 2）約 12.3 ms、水平（J ≈ 1）約 24.6 ms；自然能量散佈 σδ = γ√(C_q/(2ρ)) ≈ 6.3×10⁻⁴。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For E = 3 GeV and a bending field B = 0.6 T, ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m and U0 = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV, so at 500 mA the radiated power U0·I ≈ 215 kW; εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV. With a 528 m circumference the revolution period is T0 = 1.76 µs and the damping time τ = 2E·T0/(J·U0) is about 12.3 ms longitudinally (J ≈ 2) and 24.6 ms horizontally (J ≈ 1); the natural energy spread is σδ = γ√(C_q/(2ρ)) ≈ 6.3×10⁻⁴. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以射頻順向功率與腔壓讀數量測不同儲存電流下的束流功率，斜率即為每圈損失 U₀（扣除插件磁鐵貢獻後）；以光束線的光通量對能量曲線擬合臨界能量，並以條紋相機或束流頻譜量同步振盪頻率，與由 U₀ 推算的同步相位比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure beam power from RF forward-power and cavity-voltage readings at several stored currents; the slope gives the energy loss per turn U0 once insertion-device contributions are removed.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"E = 3 GeV、彎轉場 B = 0.6 T：ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m，U₀ = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV，500 mA 時輻射功率 U₀·I ≈ 215 kW；εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV。周長 528 m、迴轉週期 T₀ = 1.76 µs，阻尼時間 τ = 2E·T₀/(J·U₀)：縱向（J ≈ 2）約 12.3 ms、水平（J ≈ 1）約 24.6 ms；自然能量散佈 σδ = γ√(C_q/(2ρ)) ≈ 6.3×10⁻⁴。","textEn":"For E = 3 GeV and a bending field B = 0.6 T, ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m and U0 = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV, so at 500 mA the radiated power U0·I ≈ 215 kW; εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV. With a 528 m circumference the revolution period is T0 = 1.76 µs and the damping time τ = 2E·T0/(J·U0) is about 12.3 ms longitudinally (J ≈ 2) and 24.6 ms horizontally (J ≈ 1); the natural energy spread is σδ = γ√(C_q/(2ρ)) ≈ 6.3×10⁻⁴.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy\", which statement holds?","options":["腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。","發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。","E = 3 GeV、彎轉場 B = 0.6 T：ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m，U₀ = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV，500 mA 時輻射功率 U₀·I ≈ 215 kW。"],"optionsEn":["A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam.","Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.","For E = 3 GeV and a bending field B = 0.6 T, ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m and U0 = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV, so at 500 mA the radiated power U0·I ≈ 215 kW."],"answer":2,"explanation":"E = 3 GeV、彎轉場 B = 0.6 T：ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m，U₀ = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV，500 mA 時輻射功率 U₀·I ≈ 215 kW；εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For E = 3 GeV and a bending field B = 0.6 T, ρ = 3.3356×3/0.6 ≈ 16.7 m and U0 = 88.5×3⁴/16.7 ≈ 430 keV, so at 500 mA the radiated power U0·I ≈ 215 kW; εc = 0.665×3²×0.6 ≈ 3.59 keV. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a456-v12-03","title":"同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「彎轉磁鐵與輻射光錐」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Bending magnet and radiation cone” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以射頻順向功率與腔壓讀數量測不同儲存電流下的束流功率，斜率即為每圈損失 U₀（扣除插件磁鐵貢獻後）；以光束線的光通量對能量曲線擬合臨界能量，並以條紋相機或束流頻譜量同步振盪頻率，與由 U₀ 推算的同步相位比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure beam power from RF forward-power and cavity-voltage readings at several stored currents; the slope gives the energy loss per turn U0 once insertion-device contributions are removed. Fit the critical energy to a beamline's flux-versus-energy curve, and measure the synchrotron oscillation frequency with a streak camera or the beam spectrum to compare with the synchronous phase predicted from U0. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只用彎轉磁鐵估 U₀ 而漏算插件磁鐵，射頻電壓與功率留得太緊；所有插件磁鐵關閉間隙後同步相位上移、能量接受度下降，Touschek 壽命突然縮短，甚至在注入時掉束。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Estimating U0 from the dipoles alone and forgetting insertion devices leaves too little RF voltage and power; when all insertion devices close their gaps the synchronous phase rises, energy acceptance shrinks, and Touschek lifetime suddenly drops or beam is lost at injection.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以射頻順向功率與腔壓讀數量測不同儲存電流下的束流功率，斜率即為每圈損失 U₀（扣除插件磁鐵貢獻後）；以光束線的光通量對能量曲線擬合臨界能量，並以條紋相機或束流頻譜量同步振盪頻率，與由 U₀ 推算的同步相位比對。","textEn":"Measure beam power from RF forward-power and cavity-voltage readings at several stored currents; the slope gives the energy loss per turn U0 once insertion-device contributions are removed. Fit the critical energy to a beamline's flux-versus-energy curve, and measure the synchrotron oscillation frequency with a streak camera or the beam spectrum to compare with the synchronous phase predicted from U0.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy\"?","options":["以射頻順向功率與腔壓讀數量測不同儲存電流下的束流功率，斜率即為每圈損失 U₀（扣除插件磁鐵貢獻後）。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。"],"optionsEn":["Measure beam power from RF forward-power and cavity-voltage readings at several stored currents.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以射頻順向功率與腔壓讀數量測不同儲存電流下的束流功率，斜率即為每圈損失 U₀（扣除插件磁鐵貢獻後）；以光束線的光通量對能量曲線擬合臨界能量，並以條紋相機或束流頻譜量同步振盪頻率，與由 U₀ 推算的同步相位比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure beam power from RF forward-power and cavity-voltage readings at several stored currents; the slope gives the energy loss per turn U0 once insertion-device contributions are removed. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a456-v12-04","title":"同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「彎轉磁鐵與輻射光錐」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Bending magnet and radiation cone” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只用彎轉磁鐵估 U₀ 而漏算插件磁鐵，射頻電壓與功率留得太緊；所有插件磁鐵關閉間隙後同步相位上移、能量接受度下降，Touschek 壽命突然縮短，甚至在注入時掉束。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Estimating U0 from the dipoles alone and forgetting insertion devices leaves too little RF voltage and power; when all insertion devices close their gaps the synchronous phase rises, energy acceptance shrinks, and Touschek lifetime suddenly drops or beam is lost at injection. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：輻射同時是阻尼機制：能量沿動量方向損失、射頻只在縱向補回，使振盪逐漸衰減，並與量子激發的隨機擾動達成平衡，決定環的平衡發射度與能量散佈。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Radiation is also a damping mechanism: energy is lost along the momentum direction but replaced by RF only longitudinally, so oscillations decay until balanced by the random kicks of quantum excitation, which sets the ring's equilibrium emittance and energy spread.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只用彎轉磁鐵估 U₀ 而漏算插件磁鐵，射頻電壓與功率留得太緊；所有插件磁鐵關閉間隙後同步相位上移、能量接受度下降，Touschek 壽命突然縮短，甚至在注入時掉束。","textEn":"Estimating U0 from the dipoles alone and forgetting insertion devices leaves too little RF voltage and power; when all insertion devices close their gaps the synchronous phase rises, energy acceptance shrinks, and Touschek lifetime suddenly drops or beam is lost at injection.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「同步輻射、每圈能量損失與臨界能量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Synchrotron radiation, energy loss per turn and critical energy\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","只用彎轉磁鐵估 U₀ 而漏算插件磁鐵，射頻電壓與功率留得太緊。","只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Estimating U0 from the dipoles alone and forgetting insertion devices leaves too little RF voltage and power.","Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只用彎轉磁鐵估 U₀ 而漏算插件磁鐵，射頻電壓與功率留得太緊；所有插件磁鐵關閉間隙後同步相位上移、能量接受度下降，Touschek 壽命突然縮短，甚至在注入時掉束。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Estimating U0 from the dipoles alone and forgetting insertion devices leaves too little RF voltage and power; when all insertion devices close their gaps the synchronous phase rises, energy acceptance shrinks, and Touschek lifetime suddenly drops or beam is lost at injection. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a456-v12-05","title":"發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「多彎消色散晶胞」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Multi-bend achromat cell” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"水平發射度 ε 是電子束位置與角度分佈的相空間面積，決定光源亮度與同調度。量子激發發生在色散不為零的彎轉磁鐵內，因此每片磁鐵的彎轉角 θ 越小、色散函數越小，發射度越低；理論最小值（TME）與 γ²θ³ 成正比。第三代光源每個晶胞只用兩片彎轉磁鐵（DBA），第四代改用五到七片（MBA），在同一周長中把磁鐵數提高到約 3 倍，發射度因 θ³ 降低一個數量級以上，代價是更強的四極與六極磁鐵、更小的動態孔徑與更困難的注入。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「多彎消色散晶胞」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The horizontal emittance ε is the phase-space area of the electron beam's position and angle distribution and sets source brightness and coherence. Quantum excitation occurs in dipoles where dispersion is non-zero, so a smaller bending angle θ per magnet and smaller dispersion give lower emittance; the theoretical minimum (TME) scales as γ²θ³. Third-generation rings use two dipoles per cell (DBA), while fourth-generation rings use five to seven (MBA), roughly tripling the dipole count in the same circumference and cutting emittance by more than an order of magnitude through θ³, at the price of stronger quadrupoles and sextupoles, a smaller dynamic aperture and harder injection. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Multi-bend achromat cell”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：TME 極限 ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x)，C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m、γ = 5871。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The TME limit is ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x) with C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ = 5871.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「多彎消色散晶胞」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Multi-bend achromat cell”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-05-k1","title":"發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices","text":"水平發射度 ε 是電子束位置與角度分佈的相空間面積，決定光源亮度與同調度。量子激發發生在色散不為零的彎轉磁鐵內，因此每片磁鐵的彎轉角 θ 越小、色散函數越小，發射度越低；理論最小值（TME）與 γ²θ³ 成正比。","textEn":"The horizontal emittance ε is the phase-space area of the electron beam's position and angle distribution and sets source brightness and coherence. Quantum excitation occurs in dipoles where dispersion is non-zero, so a smaller bending angle θ per magnet and smaller dispersion give lower emittance; the theoretical minimum (TME) scales as γ²θ³.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices\" is correct?","options":["只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。","磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。","水平發射度 ε 是電子束位置與角度分佈的相空間面積，決定光源亮度與同調度。"],"optionsEn":["Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance.","A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam.","The horizontal emittance ε is the phase-space area of the electron beam's position and angle distribution and sets source brightness and coherence."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水平發射度 ε 是電子束位置與角度分佈的相空間面積，決定光源亮度與同調度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The horizontal emittance ε is the phase-space area of the electron beam's position and angle distribution and sets source brightness and coherence. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a456-v12-06","title":"發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格：定量估算","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「多彎消色散晶胞」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Multi-bend achromat cell” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：TME 極限 ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x)，C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m、γ = 5871。24 晶胞 DBA（48 片，θ = 0.131 rad）：ε_min ≈ 637 pm；20 晶胞 7BA（140 片，θ = 0.0449 rad）：ε_min ≈ 25.7 pm，比值 (140/48)³ ≈ 24.8。實際晶格受動態孔徑限制，通常落在理論值的數倍，取 4 倍約 100 pm；1 Å X 光的繞射極限 λ/4π ≈ 8 pm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The TME limit is ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x) with C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ = 5871. A 24-cell DBA (48 dipoles, θ = 0.131 rad) gives ε_min ≈ 637 pm; a 20-cell 7BA (140 dipoles, θ = 0.0449 rad) gives ε_min ≈ 25.7 pm, a ratio (140/48)³ ≈ 24.8. Real lattices are limited by dynamic aperture and usually sit several times above the limit; taking a factor of 4 gives about 100 pm, compared with the diffraction limit λ/4π ≈ 8 pm for 1 Å X-rays. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以晶格程式（如 MAD-X、Elegant、AT）計算線性光學與發射度，再追蹤粒子求動態孔徑與動量接受度；試運轉時以響應矩陣分析（LOCO 類方法）反推實際四極強度與色散，並用光源點尺寸量測反推發射度，三者必須互相一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compute linear optics and emittance with a lattice code such as MAD-X, Elegant or AT, then track particles to obtain dynamic aperture and momentum acceptance; during commissioning infer actual quadrupole strengths and dispersion with response-matrix analysis (LOCO-type methods) and emittance from source-size measurements, and require all three to agree.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"TME 極限 ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x)，C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m、γ = 5871。24 晶胞 DBA（48 片，θ = 0.131 rad）：ε_min ≈ 637 pm；20 晶胞 7BA（140 片，θ = 0.0449 rad）：ε_min ≈ 25.7 pm，比值 (140/48)³ ≈ 24.8。實際晶格受動態孔徑限制，通常落在理論值的數倍，取 4 倍約 100 pm；1 Å X 光的繞射極限 λ/4π ≈ 8 pm。","textEn":"The TME limit is ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x) with C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ = 5871. A 24-cell DBA (48 dipoles, θ = 0.131 rad) gives ε_min ≈ 637 pm; a 20-cell 7BA (140 dipoles, θ = 0.0449 rad) gives ε_min ≈ 25.7 pm, a ratio (140/48)³ ≈ 24.8. Real lattices are limited by dynamic aperture and usually sit several times above the limit; taking a factor of 4 gives about 100 pm, compared with the diffraction limit λ/4π ≈ 8 pm for 1 Å X-rays.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices\", which statement holds?","options":["TME 極限 ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x)，C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m、γ = 5871。","拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。","插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。"],"optionsEn":["The TME limit is ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x) with C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ = 5871.","The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response.","An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users."],"answer":0,"explanation":"TME 極限 ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x)，C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m、γ = 5871。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The TME limit is ε_min = C_q·γ²·θ³/(12√15·J_x) with C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ = 5871. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a456-v12-07","title":"發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「多彎消色散晶胞」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Multi-bend achromat cell” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以晶格程式（如 MAD-X、Elegant、AT）計算線性光學與發射度，再追蹤粒子求動態孔徑與動量接受度；試運轉時以響應矩陣分析（LOCO 類方法）反推實際四極強度與色散，並用光源點尺寸量測反推發射度，三者必須互相一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compute linear optics and emittance with a lattice code such as MAD-X, Elegant or AT, then track particles to obtain dynamic aperture and momentum acceptance; during commissioning infer actual quadrupole strengths and dispersion with response-matrix analysis (LOCO-type methods) and emittance from source-size measurements, and require all three to agree. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了追求最低發射度把晶格推到極限，六極磁鐵強度過大，動態孔徑只剩數毫米，注入效率長期偏低且對磁鐵誤差極敏感；機器可以達到設計發射度，卻無法穩定做頂注運轉。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Pushing the lattice to its limit for the lowest emittance needs sextupoles so strong that dynamic aperture shrinks to a few millimetres, leaving injection efficiency chronically low and very sensitive to magnet errors; the machine reaches design emittance but cannot sustain top-up operation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以晶格程式（如 MAD-X、Elegant、AT）計算線性光學與發射度，再追蹤粒子求動態孔徑與動量接受度；試運轉時以響應矩陣分析（LOCO 類方法）反推實際四極強度與色散，並用光源點尺寸量測反推發射度，三者必須互相一致。","textEn":"Compute linear optics and emittance with a lattice code such as MAD-X, Elegant or AT, then track particles to obtain dynamic aperture and momentum acceptance; during commissioning infer actual quadrupole strengths and dispersion with response-matrix analysis (LOCO-type methods) and emittance from source-size measurements, and require all three to agree.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以晶格程式（如 MAD-X、Elegant、AT）計算線性光學與發射度，再追蹤粒子求動態孔徑與動量接受度。","頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Compute linear optics and emittance with a lattice code such as MAD-X, Elegant or AT, then track particles to obtain dynamic aperture and momentum acceptance.","Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以晶格程式（如 MAD-X、Elegant、AT）計算線性光學與發射度，再追蹤粒子求動態孔徑與動量接受度；試運轉時以響應矩陣分析（LOCO 類方法）反推實際四極強度與色散，並用光源點尺寸量測反推發射度，三者必須互相一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compute linear optics and emittance with a lattice code such as MAD-X, Elegant or AT, then track particles to obtain dynamic aperture and momentum acceptance; during commissioning infer actual quadrupole strengths and dispersion with response-matrix analysis (LOCO-type methods) and emittance from source-size measurements, and require all three to agree. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a456-v12-08","title":"發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格：失效診斷","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「多彎消色散晶胞」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Multi-bend achromat cell” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了追求最低發射度把晶格推到極限，六極磁鐵強度過大，動態孔徑只剩數毫米，注入效率長期偏低且對磁鐵誤差極敏感；機器可以達到設計發射度，卻無法穩定做頂注運轉。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Pushing the lattice to its limit for the lowest emittance needs sextupoles so strong that dynamic aperture shrinks to a few millimetres, leaving injection efficiency chronically low and very sensitive to magnet errors; the machine reaches design emittance but cannot sustain top-up operation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：第三代光源每個晶胞只用兩片彎轉磁鐵（DBA），第四代改用五到七片（MBA），在同一周長中把磁鐵數提高到約 3 倍，發射度因 θ³ 降低一個數量級以上，代價是更強的四極與六極磁鐵、更小的動態孔徑與更困難的注入。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Third-generation rings use two dipoles per cell (DBA), while fourth-generation rings use five to seven (MBA), roughly tripling the dipole count in the same circumference and cutting emittance by more than an order of magnitude through θ³, at the price of stronger quadrupoles and sextupoles, a smaller dynamic aperture and harder injection.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了追求最低發射度把晶格推到極限，六極磁鐵強度過大，動態孔徑只剩數毫米，注入效率長期偏低且對磁鐵誤差極敏感；機器可以達到設計發射度，卻無法穩定做頂注運轉。","textEn":"Pushing the lattice to its limit for the lowest emittance needs sextupoles so strong that dynamic aperture shrinks to a few millimetres, leaving injection efficiency chronically low and very sensitive to magnet errors; the machine reaches design emittance but cannot sustain top-up operation.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「發射度標度律與多彎消色散晶格」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Emittance scaling and multi-bend achromat lattices\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。","為了追求最低發射度把晶格推到極限，六極磁鐵強度過大，動態孔徑只剩數毫米，注入效率長期偏低且對磁鐵誤差極敏感；機器可以達到設計發射度，卻無法穩定做頂注運轉。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam.","Pushing the lattice to its limit for the lowest emittance needs sextupoles so strong that dynamic aperture shrinks to a few millimetres, leaving injection efficiency chronically low and very sensitive to magnet errors."],"answer":2,"explanation":"為了追求最低發射度把晶格推到極限，六極磁鐵強度過大，動態孔徑只剩數毫米，注入效率長期偏低且對磁鐵誤差極敏感；機器可以達到設計發射度，卻無法穩定做頂注運轉。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Pushing the lattice to its limit for the lowest emittance needs sextupoles so strong that dynamic aperture shrinks to a few millimetres, leaving injection efficiency chronically low and very sensitive to magnet errors; the machine reaches design emittance but cannot sustain top-up operation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a456-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差」與「射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances\" and \"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a456-v12-09","title":"磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「小孔徑四極磁鐵與磁鐵座」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Small-bore quadrupoles and girders” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"MBA 晶格要求 50 T/m 以上的四極梯度與很強的六極，鐵芯磁極尖端磁場 B_tip = G·r 必須低於鐵的飽和（設計上約 1 T 以下較安全），因此只能縮小孔徑；孔徑縮小又讓所需安匝數按 r² 下降，磁鐵更小、更省電，但真空管只剩約 20 mm 內徑。磁鐵以數十微米精度預先對準在共同的磁鐵座上，再整座安裝；四極磁鐵偏離束流中心 Δx 時會給電子一個偏轉 θ = K₁L·Δx，經閉合軌道放大後，整圈軌道都會偏移。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「小孔徑四極磁鐵與磁鐵座」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"MBA lattices need quadrupole gradients above 50 T/m and very strong sextupoles, and the iron pole-tip field B_tip = G·r must stay below saturation, safely under about 1 T, so the bore must shrink; a smaller bore also cuts the required ampere-turns as r², making magnets smaller and cheaper to power, but leaves only about 20 mm inner diameter for the vacuum chamber. Magnets are pre-aligned to tens of micrometres on common girders that are installed as units; a quadrupole offset Δx from the beam axis gives the electrons a kick θ = K1L·Δx that the closed orbit amplifies around the whole ring. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Small-bore quadrupoles and girders”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：每極安匝 NI = G·r²/(2μ₀)：G = 50 T/m、r = 12.5 mm 時 NI ≈ 3110 A·turn、B_tip = 0.625 T；若 r = 35 mm，NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn（7.8 倍，功耗約 61 倍），且 B_tip = 1.75 T 已超過鐵的飽和。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Ampere-turns per pole are NI = G·r²/(2μ0): with G = 50 T/m and r = 12.5 mm, NI ≈ 3110 A·turn and B_tip = 0.625 T; at r = 35 mm, NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn (7.8 times, about 61 times the power) and B_tip = 1.75 T is beyond iron saturation.","failure":"常見誤解：「磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「小孔徑四極磁鐵與磁鐵座」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Small-bore quadrupoles and girders”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-09-k1","title":"磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差","titleEn":"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances","text":"MBA 晶格要求 50 T/m 以上的四極梯度與很強的六極，鐵芯磁極尖端磁場 B_tip = G·r 必須低於鐵的飽和（設計上約 1 T 以下較安全），因此只能縮小孔徑；孔徑縮小又讓所需安匝數按 r² 下降，磁鐵更小、更省電，但真空管只剩約 20 mm 內徑。磁鐵以數十微米精度預先對準在共同的磁鐵座上，再整座安裝；四極磁鐵偏離束流中心 Δx 時會給電子一個偏轉 θ = K₁L·Δx，經閉合軌道放大後，整圈軌道都會偏移。","textEn":"MBA lattices need quadrupole gradients above 50 T/m and very strong sextupoles, and the iron pole-tip field B_tip = G·r must stay below saturation, safely under about 1 T, so the bore must shrink; a smaller bore also cuts the required ampere-turns as r², making magnets smaller and cheaper to power, but leaves only about 20 mm inner diameter for the vacuum chamber. Magnets are pre-aligned to tens of micrometres on common girders that are installed as units; a quadrupole offset Δx from the beam axis gives the electrons a kick θ = K1L·Δx that the closed orbit amplifies around the whole ring.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances\" is correct?","options":["MBA 晶格要求 50 T/m 以上的四極梯度與很強的六極，鐵芯磁極尖端磁場 B_tip = G·r 必須低於鐵的飽和（設計上約 1 T 以下較安全），因此只能縮小孔徑。","磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。","腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。"],"optionsEn":["MBA lattices need quadrupole gradients above 50 T/m and very strong sextupoles, and the iron pole-tip field B_tip = G·r must stay below saturation, safely under about 1 T, so the bore must shrink.","A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam.","A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam."],"answer":0,"explanation":"MBA 晶格要求 50 T/m 以上的四極梯度與很強的六極，鐵芯磁極尖端磁場 B_tip = G·r 必須低於鐵的飽和（設計上約 1 T 以下較安全），因此只能縮小孔徑；孔徑縮小又讓所需安匝數按 r² 下降，磁鐵更小、更省電，但真空管只剩約 20 mm 內徑。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"MBA lattices need quadrupole gradients above 50 T/m and very strong sextupoles, and the iron pole-tip field B_tip = G·r must stay below saturation, safely under about 1 T, so the bore must shrink; a smaller bore also cuts the required ampere-turns as r², making magnets smaller and cheaper to power, but leaves only about 20 mm inner diameter for the vacuum chamber. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a456-v12-10","title":"磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差：定量估算","titleEn":"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「小孔徑四極磁鐵與磁鐵座」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Small-bore quadrupoles and girders” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：每極安匝 NI = G·r²/(2μ₀)：G = 50 T/m、r = 12.5 mm 時 NI ≈ 3110 A·turn、B_tip = 0.625 T；若 r = 35 mm，NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn（7.8 倍，功耗約 61 倍），且 B_tip = 1.75 T 已超過鐵的飽和。偏移：Bρ = 10.0 T·m、L = 0.25 m，K₁L ≈ 1.25 m⁻¹，Δx = 30 µm 產生 37.5 µrad；兩處 β = 5 m、工作點 ν = 42.2 時閉合軌道最大偏移 ≈ β/(2|sin πν|)×θ ≈ 4.25 m×37.5 µrad ≈ 159 µm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Ampere-turns per pole are NI = G·r²/(2μ0): with G = 50 T/m and r = 12.5 mm, NI ≈ 3110 A·turn and B_tip = 0.625 T; at r = 35 mm, NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn (7.8 times, about 61 times the power) and B_tip = 1.75 T is beyond iron saturation. Offset: with Bρ = 10.0 T·m and L = 0.25 m, K1L ≈ 1.25 m⁻¹, so Δx = 30 µm gives 37.5 µrad; with β = 5 m at both locations and tune ν = 42.2, the peak closed-orbit shift ≈ β/(2|sin πν|)×θ ≈ 4.25 m×37.5 µrad ≈ 159 µm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：磁鐵出廠時以旋轉線圈或拉伸線量測梯度、多極成分與磁中心，記錄磁中心相對機械基準的偏差；上座後以雷射追蹤儀量磁鐵座相對位置；運轉時以束流基準對準（調變單一四極強度、找出軌道不變的位置）反推每個四極相對 BPM 的偏移。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At the factory, measure gradient, multipole content and magnetic center with a rotating coil or stretched wire, and record the magnetic center relative to mechanical fiducials; after mounting, survey girder positions with a laser tracker; in operation, use beam-based alignment, modulating one quadrupole and finding where the orbit stops changing, to infer each quadrupole's offset from its BPM.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"每極安匝 NI = G·r²/(2μ₀)：G = 50 T/m、r = 12.5 mm 時 NI ≈ 3110 A·turn、B_tip = 0.625 T；若 r = 35 mm，NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn（7.8 倍，功耗約 61 倍），且 B_tip = 1.75 T 已超過鐵的飽和。偏移：Bρ = 10.0 T·m、L = 0.25 m，K₁L ≈ 1.25 m⁻¹，Δx = 30 µm 產生 37.5 µrad；兩處 β = 5 m、工作點 ν = 42.2 時閉合軌道最大偏移 ≈ β/(2|sin πν|)×θ ≈ 4.25 m×37.5 µrad ≈ 159 µm。","textEn":"Ampere-turns per pole are NI = G·r²/(2μ0): with G = 50 T/m and r = 12.5 mm, NI ≈ 3110 A·turn and B_tip = 0.625 T; at r = 35 mm, NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn (7.8 times, about 61 times the power) and B_tip = 1.75 T is beyond iron saturation. Offset: with Bρ = 10.0 T·m and L = 0.25 m, K1L ≈ 1.25 m⁻¹, so Δx = 30 µm gives 37.5 µrad; with β = 5 m at both locations and tune ν = 42.2, the peak closed-orbit shift ≈ β/(2|sin πν|)×θ ≈ 4.25 m×37.5 µrad ≈ 159 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances\", which statement holds?","options":["發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。","每極安匝 NI = G·r²/(2μ₀)：G = 50 T/m、r = 12.5 mm 時 NI ≈ 3110 A·turn、B_tip = 0.625 T。","頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。"],"optionsEn":["Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.","Ampere-turns per pole are NI = G·r²/(2μ0): with G = 50 T/m and r = 12.5 mm, NI ≈ 3110 A·turn and B_tip = 0.625 T.","Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每極安匝 NI = G·r²/(2μ₀)：G = 50 T/m、r = 12.5 mm 時 NI ≈ 3110 A·turn、B_tip = 0.625 T；若 r = 35 mm，NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn（7.8 倍，功耗約 61 倍），且 B_tip = 1.75 T 已超過鐵的飽和。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Ampere-turns per pole are NI = G·r²/(2μ0): with G = 50 T/m and r = 12.5 mm, NI ≈ 3110 A·turn and B_tip = 0.625 T; at r = 35 mm, NI ≈ 24 400 A·turn (7.8 times, about 61 times the power) and B_tip = 1.75 T is beyond iron saturation. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a456-v12-11","title":"磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「小孔徑四極磁鐵與磁鐵座」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Small-bore quadrupoles and girders” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"磁鐵出廠時以旋轉線圈或拉伸線量測梯度、多極成分與磁中心，記錄磁中心相對機械基準的偏差；上座後以雷射追蹤儀量磁鐵座相對位置；運轉時以束流基準對準（調變單一四極強度、找出軌道不變的位置）反推每個四極相對 BPM 的偏移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At the factory, measure gradient, multipole content and magnetic center with a rotating coil or stretched wire, and record the magnetic center relative to mechanical fiducials; after mounting, survey girder positions with a laser tracker; in operation, use beam-based alignment, modulating one quadrupole and finding where the orbit stops changing, to infer each quadrupole's offset from its BPM. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：磁鐵座安裝在溫度尚未穩定的混凝土地板上，地板隨季節與日照緩慢變形，數十微米的漂移累積成數百微米的軌道偏差；軌道回授雖能補正，但修正子強度逐月爬升，最終耗盡修正範圍。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Girders installed on concrete that has not reached thermal equilibrium drift with seasons and sunlight; tens of micrometres of movement accumulate into hundreds of micrometres of orbit error, and although orbit feedback compensates, corrector strengths creep upward month by month until their range is exhausted.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"磁鐵出廠時以旋轉線圈或拉伸線量測梯度、多極成分與磁中心，記錄磁中心相對機械基準的偏差；上座後以雷射追蹤儀量磁鐵座相對位置；運轉時以束流基準對準（調變單一四極強度、找出軌道不變的位置）反推每個四極相對 BPM 的偏移。","textEn":"At the factory, measure gradient, multipole content and magnetic center with a rotating coil or stretched wire, and record the magnetic center relative to mechanical fiducials; after mounting, survey girder positions with a laser tracker; in operation, use beam-based alignment, modulating one quadrupole and finding where the orbit stops changing, to infer each quadrupole's offset from its BPM.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。","磁鐵出廠時以旋轉線圈或拉伸線量測梯度、多極成分與磁中心，記錄磁中心相對機械基準的偏差。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.","At the factory, measure gradient, multipole content and magnetic center with a rotating coil or stretched wire, and record the magnetic center relative to mechanical fiducials."],"answer":2,"explanation":"磁鐵出廠時以旋轉線圈或拉伸線量測梯度、多極成分與磁中心，記錄磁中心相對機械基準的偏差；上座後以雷射追蹤儀量磁鐵座相對位置；運轉時以束流基準對準（調變單一四極強度、找出軌道不變的位置）反推每個四極相對 BPM 的偏移。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"At the factory, measure gradient, multipole content and magnetic center with a rotating coil or stretched wire, and record the magnetic center relative to mechanical fiducials; after mounting, survey girder positions with a laser tracker; in operation, use beam-based alignment, modulating one quadrupole and finding where the orbit stops changing, to infer each quadrupole's offset from its BPM. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a456-v12-12","title":"磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「小孔徑四極磁鐵與磁鐵座」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Small-bore quadrupoles and girders” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"磁鐵座安裝在溫度尚未穩定的混凝土地板上，地板隨季節與日照緩慢變形，數十微米的漂移累積成數百微米的軌道偏差；軌道回授雖能補正，但修正子強度逐月爬升，最終耗盡修正範圍。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Girders installed on concrete that has not reached thermal equilibrium drift with seasons and sunlight; tens of micrometres of movement accumulate into hundreds of micrometres of orbit error, and although orbit feedback compensates, corrector strengths creep upward month by month until their range is exhausted. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：磁鐵以數十微米精度預先對準在共同的磁鐵座上，再整座安裝；四極磁鐵偏離束流中心 Δx 時會給電子一個偏轉 θ = K₁L·Δx，經閉合軌道放大後，整圈軌道都會偏移。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Magnets are pre-aligned to tens of micrometres on common girders that are installed as units; a quadrupole offset Δx from the beam axis gives the electrons a kick θ = K1L·Δx that the closed orbit amplifies around the whole ring.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"磁鐵座安裝在溫度尚未穩定的混凝土地板上，地板隨季節與日照緩慢變形，數十微米的漂移累積成數百微米的軌道偏差；軌道回授雖能補正，但修正子強度逐月爬升，最終耗盡修正範圍。","textEn":"Girders installed on concrete that has not reached thermal equilibrium drift with seasons and sunlight; tens of micrometres of movement accumulate into hundreds of micrometres of orbit error, and although orbit feedback compensates, corrector strengths creep upward month by month until their range is exhausted.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「磁鐵孔徑、梯度與對準公差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Magnet bore, gradient and alignment tolerances\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["磁鐵座安裝在溫度尚未穩定的混凝土地板上，地板隨季節與日照緩慢變形，數十微米的漂移累積成數百微米的軌道偏差。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。"],"optionsEn":["Girders installed on concrete that has not reached thermal equilibrium drift with seasons and sunlight.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam."],"answer":0,"explanation":"磁鐵座安裝在溫度尚未穩定的混凝土地板上，地板隨季節與日照緩慢變形，數十微米的漂移累積成數百微米的軌道偏差；軌道回授雖能補正，但修正子強度逐月爬升，最終耗盡修正範圍。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Girders installed on concrete that has not reached thermal equilibrium drift with seasons and sunlight; tens of micrometres of movement accumulate into hundreds of micrometres of orbit error, and although orbit feedback compensates, corrector strengths creep upward month by month until their range is exhausted. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a456-v12-13","title":"射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「射頻腔與高功率放大器」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “RF cavities and high-power amplifiers” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"射頻腔以迴轉頻率整數倍（諧波數 h）的電場加速電子，同步電子每次通過剛好拿回 U₀，相位滿足 eV·sin φs = U₀。早到與晚到的電子拿到不同能量，在色散造成的路徑差下繞同步點做縱向同步振盪，形成束團；腔壓相對 U₀ 的過電壓比 q 決定 RF 桶的高度，也就是可容許的能量偏差。射頻功率除了供給束流損失，還要支付腔壁的歐姆損耗，並隨插件磁鐵間隙改變而變動，因此低階射頻控制（LLRF）必須穩住振幅與相位。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「射頻腔與高功率放大器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"RF cavities accelerate electrons with a field at an integer multiple h of the revolution frequency, and the synchronous electron regains exactly U0 each pass at a phase satisfying eV·sin φs = U0. Early and late electrons gain different energies and, through the path-length difference caused by dispersion, perform longitudinal synchrotron oscillations about the synchronous point, forming bunches; the overvoltage ratio q of cavity voltage to U0 sets the height of the RF bucket, the tolerable energy deviation. RF power must cover the beam loss plus cavity wall losses and changes as insertion-device gaps move, so the low-level RF control must hold amplitude and phase steady. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “RF cavities and high-power amplifiers”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：528 m、100 MHz：h = 176。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For 528 m and 100 MHz, h = 176.","failure":"常見誤解：「腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「射頻腔與高功率放大器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “RF cavities and high-power amplifiers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-13-k1","title":"射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度","titleEn":"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance","text":"射頻腔以迴轉頻率整數倍（諧波數 h）的電場加速電子，同步電子每次通過剛好拿回 U₀，相位滿足 eV·sin φs = U₀。早到與晚到的電子拿到不同能量，在色散造成的路徑差下繞同步點做縱向同步振盪，形成束團；腔壓相對 U₀ 的過電壓比 q 決定 RF 桶的高度，也就是可容許的能量偏差。","textEn":"RF cavities accelerate electrons with a field at an integer multiple h of the revolution frequency, and the synchronous electron regains exactly U0 each pass at a phase satisfying eV·sin φs = U0. Early and late electrons gain different energies and, through the path-length difference caused by dispersion, perform longitudinal synchrotron oscillations about the synchronous point, forming bunches; the overvoltage ratio q of cavity voltage to U0 sets the height of the RF bucket, the tolerable energy deviation.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance\" is correct?","options":["腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。","射頻腔以迴轉頻率整數倍（諧波數 h）的電場加速電子，同步電子每次通過剛好拿回 U₀，相位滿足 eV·sin φs = U₀。","拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。"],"optionsEn":["A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam.","RF cavities accelerate electrons with a field at an integer multiple h of the revolution frequency, and the synchronous electron regains exactly U0 each pass at a phase satisfying eV·sin φs = U0.","The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response."],"answer":1,"explanation":"射頻腔以迴轉頻率整數倍（諧波數 h）的電場加速電子，同步電子每次通過剛好拿回 U₀，相位滿足 eV·sin φs = U₀。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"RF cavities accelerate electrons with a field at an integer multiple h of the revolution frequency, and the synchronous electron regains exactly U0 each pass at a phase satisfying eV·sin φs = U0. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a456-v12-14","title":"射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度：定量估算","titleEn":"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「射頻腔與高功率放大器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “RF cavities and high-power amplifiers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：528 m、100 MHz：h = 176。U₀ = 430 keV（彎轉）+ 200 keV（插件）= 0.63 MeV，腔壓 V = 1.6 MV：q = 2.54，φs = arcsin(1/q) ≈ 23.2°。動量壓縮 α_c = 3×10⁻⁴ 時 RF 接受度 δ = √[(2U₀/(πα_c hE))·(√(q² − 1) − arccos(1/q))] ≈ 5.4%，同步頻率 f_s = f_rev·√(hα_c eV cos φs/(2πE)) ≈ 1.15 kHz。功率：束流 0.63 MV×0.5 A = 315 kW，六個腔各 R_s = 3 MΩ 的壁損 6×(0.267 MV)²/(2×3 MΩ) ≈ 71 kW，共約 386 kW。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For 528 m and 100 MHz, h = 176. With U0 = 430 keV from dipoles plus 200 keV from insertion devices, 0.63 MeV, and V = 1.6 MV, q = 2.54 and φs = arcsin(1/q) ≈ 23.2°. With momentum compaction α_c = 3×10⁻⁴ the RF acceptance δ = √[(2U0/(πα_c hE))·(√(q² − 1) − arccos(1/q))] ≈ 5.4%, and the synchrotron frequency f_s = f_rev·√(hα_c eV cos φs/(2πE)) ≈ 1.15 kHz. Power: beam 0.63 MV×0.5 A = 315 kW plus wall losses of six cavities with R_s = 3 MΩ, 6×(0.267 MV)²/(2×3 MΩ) ≈ 71 kW, about 386 kW in total. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以束流頻譜分析儀量同步頻率旁帶並換算腔壓與 φs，與 LLRF 的腔壓讀數比對；逐步降低腔壓直到壽命開始下降，判斷實際接受度由射頻還是由晶格動量接受度限制；高功率端記錄順向與反射功率、腔體溫度與調諧器位置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the synchrotron-frequency sidebands with a beam spectrum analyser and convert them to cavity voltage and φs, comparing with the LLRF voltage readings; lower the voltage step by step until lifetime begins to fall to find whether acceptance is limited by the RF or by the lattice momentum acceptance; on the high-power side log forward and reflected power, cavity temperatures and tuner positions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"528 m、100 MHz：h = 176。U₀ = 430 keV（彎轉）+ 200 keV（插件）= 0.63 MeV，腔壓 V = 1.6 MV：q = 2.54，φs = arcsin(1/q) ≈ 23.2°。動量壓縮 α_c = 3×10⁻⁴ 時 RF 接受度 δ = √[(2U₀/(πα_c hE))·(√(q² − 1) − arccos(1/q))] ≈ 5.4%，同步頻率 f_s = f_rev·√(hα_c eV cos φs/(2πE)) ≈ 1.15 kHz。功率：束流 0.63 MV×0.5 A = 315 kW，六個腔各 R_s = 3 MΩ 的壁損 6×(0.267 MV)²/(2×3 MΩ) ≈ 71 kW，共約 386 kW。","textEn":"For 528 m and 100 MHz, h = 176. With U0 = 430 keV from dipoles plus 200 keV from insertion devices, 0.63 MeV, and V = 1.6 MV, q = 2.54 and φs = arcsin(1/q) ≈ 23.2°. With momentum compaction α_c = 3×10⁻⁴ the RF acceptance δ = √[(2U0/(πα_c hE))·(√(q² − 1) − arccos(1/q))] ≈ 5.4%, and the synchrotron frequency f_s = f_rev·√(hα_c eV cos φs/(2πE)) ≈ 1.15 kHz. Power: beam 0.63 MV×0.5 A = 315 kW plus wall losses of six cavities with R_s = 3 MΩ, 6×(0.267 MV)²/(2×3 MΩ) ≈ 71 kW, about 386 kW in total.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance\", which statement holds?","options":["插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。","儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。","528 m、100 MHz：h = 176。"],"optionsEn":["An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users.","Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.","For 528 m and 100 MHz, h = 176."],"answer":2,"explanation":"528 m、100 MHz：h = 176。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For 528 m and 100 MHz, h = 176. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a456-v12-15","title":"射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「射頻腔與高功率放大器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “RF cavities and high-power amplifiers” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以束流頻譜分析儀量同步頻率旁帶並換算腔壓與 φs，與 LLRF 的腔壓讀數比對；逐步降低腔壓直到壽命開始下降，判斷實際接受度由射頻還是由晶格動量接受度限制；高功率端記錄順向與反射功率、腔體溫度與調諧器位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the synchrotron-frequency sidebands with a beam spectrum analyser and convert them to cavity voltage and φs, comparing with the LLRF voltage readings; lower the voltage step by step until lifetime begins to fall to find whether acceptance is limited by the RF or by the lattice momentum acceptance; on the high-power side log forward and reflected power, cavity temperatures and tuner positions. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：高電流下腔體的束流負載使腔壓相位偏移，若調諧與 LLRF 前饋不足，會激發耦合束團不穩定，束團長度與能量散佈週期性跳動，光束線看到強度與光點位置在 kHz 頻段抖動。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: At high current, beam loading shifts cavity voltage and phase; with insufficient tuning and LLRF feedforward, coupled-bunch instabilities develop, bunch length and energy spread oscillate, and beamlines see intensity and spot-position jitter in the kilohertz band.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以束流頻譜分析儀量同步頻率旁帶並換算腔壓與 φs，與 LLRF 的腔壓讀數比對；逐步降低腔壓直到壽命開始下降，判斷實際接受度由射頻還是由晶格動量接受度限制；高功率端記錄順向與反射功率、腔體溫度與調諧器位置。","textEn":"Measure the synchrotron-frequency sidebands with a beam spectrum analyser and convert them to cavity voltage and φs, comparing with the LLRF voltage readings; lower the voltage step by step until lifetime begins to fall to find whether acceptance is limited by the RF or by the lattice momentum acceptance; on the high-power side log forward and reflected power, cavity temperatures and tuner positions.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance\"?","options":["以束流頻譜分析儀量同步頻率旁帶並換算腔壓與 φs，與 LLRF 的腔壓讀數比對。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the synchrotron-frequency sidebands with a beam spectrum analyser and convert them to cavity voltage and φs, comparing with the LLRF voltage readings.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以束流頻譜分析儀量同步頻率旁帶並換算腔壓與 φs，與 LLRF 的腔壓讀數比對；逐步降低腔壓直到壽命開始下降，判斷實際接受度由射頻還是由晶格動量接受度限制；高功率端記錄順向與反射功率、腔體溫度與調諧器位置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the synchrotron-frequency sidebands with a beam spectrum analyser and convert them to cavity voltage and φs, comparing with the LLRF voltage readings; lower the voltage step by step until lifetime begins to fall to find whether acceptance is limited by the RF or by the lattice momentum acceptance; on the high-power side log forward and reflected power, cavity temperatures and tuner positions. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a456-v12-16","title":"射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度：失效診斷","titleEn":"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「射頻腔與高功率放大器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “RF cavities and high-power amplifiers” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"高電流下腔體的束流負載使腔壓相位偏移，若調諧與 LLRF 前饋不足，會激發耦合束團不穩定，束團長度與能量散佈週期性跳動，光束線看到強度與光點位置在 kHz 頻段抖動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"At high current, beam loading shifts cavity voltage and phase; with insufficient tuning and LLRF feedforward, coupled-bunch instabilities develop, bunch length and energy spread oscillate, and beamlines see intensity and spot-position jitter in the kilohertz band. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：射頻功率除了供給束流損失，還要支付腔壁的歐姆損耗，並隨插件磁鐵間隙改變而變動，因此低階射頻控制（LLRF）必須穩住振幅與相位。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: RF power must cover the beam loss plus cavity wall losses and changes as insertion-device gaps move, so the low-level RF control must hold amplitude and phase steady.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"高電流下腔體的束流負載使腔壓相位偏移，若調諧與 LLRF 前饋不足，會激發耦合束團不穩定，束團長度與能量散佈週期性跳動，光束線看到強度與光點位置在 kHz 頻段抖動。","textEn":"At high current, beam loading shifts cavity voltage and phase; with insufficient tuning and LLRF feedforward, coupled-bunch instabilities develop, bunch length and energy spread oscillate, and beamlines see intensity and spot-position jitter in the kilohertz band.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「射頻系統：補回 U₀、同步相位與 RF 接受度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"RF system: replacing U0, synchronous phase and RF acceptance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","高電流下腔體的束流負載使腔壓相位偏移，若調諧與 LLRF 前饋不足，會激發耦合束團不穩定，束團長度與能量散佈週期性跳動，光束線看到強度與光點位置在 kHz 頻段抖動。","拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","At high current, beam loading shifts cavity voltage and phase.","The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response."],"answer":1,"explanation":"高電流下腔體的束流負載使腔壓相位偏移，若調諧與 LLRF 前饋不足，會激發耦合束團不穩定，束團長度與能量散佈週期性跳動，光束線看到強度與光點位置在 kHz 頻段抖動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"At high current, beam loading shifts cavity voltage and phase; with insufficient tuning and LLRF feedforward, coupled-bunch instabilities develop, bunch length and energy spread oscillate, and beamlines see intensity and spot-position jitter in the kilohertz band. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a456-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「束流尺寸量測與發射度反推」與「束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion\" and \"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a456-v12-17","title":"束流尺寸量測與發射度反推：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「X 光針孔相機與光源點」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “X-ray pinhole camera and source point” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"發射度無法直接量，只能從某處的束流尺寸反推：σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²)，其中 β 與色散 η 來自晶格量測，σδ 來自能量散佈量測。MBA 環的垂直尺寸只有數微米，可見光成像受繞射限制而失效，必須用 X 光針孔相機、繞射式成像或同步光干涉儀。量到的是束流尺寸與儀器點擴散函數（PSF）的捲積，因此 PSF 的校正誤差會直接放大成發射度誤差，尤其當束流尺寸與 PSF 相當時。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「X 光針孔相機與光源點」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Emittance cannot be measured directly; it is inferred from a beam size somewhere through σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²), with β and dispersion η from lattice measurements and σδ from energy-spread measurement. Vertical sizes in an MBA ring are only a few micrometres, beyond diffraction-limited visible-light imaging, so X-ray pinhole cameras, diffractive imaging or synchrotron-light interferometers are used. The measured value is the beam size convolved with the instrument point-spread function (PSF), so PSF calibration error is amplified directly into emittance error, especially when beam size and PSF are comparable. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “X-ray pinhole camera and source point”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：光源點 β_x = 1 m、η = 5 mm、ε_x = 100 pm、σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴：σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm；若忽略色散項，反推 ε ≈ 110 pm，高估 10%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At a source point with β_x = 1 m, η = 5 mm, ε_x = 100 pm and σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴, σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm; ignoring the dispersion term would infer ε ≈ 110 pm, 10% high.","failure":"常見誤解：「拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「X 光針孔相機與光源點」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “X-ray pinhole camera and source point”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-17-k1","title":"束流尺寸量測與發射度反推","titleEn":"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion","text":"發射度無法直接量，只能從某處的束流尺寸反推：σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²)，其中 β 與色散 η 來自晶格量測，σδ 來自能量散佈量測。MBA 環的垂直尺寸只有數微米，可見光成像受繞射限制而失效，必須用 X 光針孔相機、繞射式成像或同步光干涉儀。","textEn":"Emittance cannot be measured directly; it is inferred from a beam size somewhere through σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²), with β and dispersion η from lattice measurements and σδ from energy-spread measurement. Vertical sizes in an MBA ring are only a few micrometres, beyond diffraction-limited visible-light imaging, so X-ray pinhole cameras, diffractive imaging or synchrotron-light interferometers are used.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「束流尺寸量測與發射度反推」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion\" is correct?","options":["拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。","發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。","發射度無法直接量，只能從某處的束流尺寸反推：σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²)，其中 β 與色散 η 來自晶格量測，σδ 來自能量散佈量測。"],"optionsEn":["The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response.","Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.","Emittance cannot be measured directly."],"answer":2,"explanation":"發射度無法直接量，只能從某處的束流尺寸反推：σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²)，其中 β 與色散 η 來自晶格量測，σδ 來自能量散佈量測。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Emittance cannot be measured directly; it is inferred from a beam size somewhere through σ = √(β·ε + (η·σδ)²), with β and dispersion η from lattice measurements and σδ from energy-spread measurement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a456-v12-18","title":"束流尺寸量測與發射度反推：定量估算","titleEn":"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「X 光針孔相機與光源點」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “X-ray pinhole camera and source point” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：光源點 β_x = 1 m、η = 5 mm、ε_x = 100 pm、σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴：σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm；若忽略色散項，反推 ε ≈ 110 pm，高估 10%。垂直 β_y = 3 m、ε_y = 5 pm：σ_y ≈ 3.87 µm；PSF 3.0 µm 時量得 √(3.87² + 3²) ≈ 4.90 µm，PSF 不確定 ±0.5 µm 造成 σ_y 誤差 3×0.5/3.87 ≈ 0.39 µm（10%），ε_y 誤差約 20%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At a source point with β_x = 1 m, η = 5 mm, ε_x = 100 pm and σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴, σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm; ignoring the dispersion term would infer ε ≈ 110 pm, 10% high. Vertically, β_y = 3 m and ε_y = 5 pm give σ_y ≈ 3.87 µm; with a 3.0 µm PSF the measured size is √(3.87² + 3²) ≈ 4.90 µm, and a ±0.5 µm PSF uncertainty produces a σ_y error of 3×0.5/3.87 ≈ 0.39 µm (10%), about 20% in ε_y. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在兩個 β 或 η 不同的光源點同時量測，聯立解出 ε 與 σδ；PSF 以改變針孔尺寸或用已知的小尺寸光源校正；再以斜四極調整耦合改變 ε_y，確認量到的尺寸變化與模型一致，並與 Touschek 壽命隨 ε_y 的變化交叉驗證。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure simultaneously at two source points with different β or η and solve jointly for ε and σδ; calibrate the PSF by changing pinhole size or using a known small source; then change ε_y with skew quadrupoles and confirm that the measured size change follows the model, cross-checking against the variation of Touschek lifetime with ε_y.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"光源點 β_x = 1 m、η = 5 mm、ε_x = 100 pm、σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴：σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm；若忽略色散項，反推 ε ≈ 110 pm，高估 10%。垂直 β_y = 3 m、ε_y = 5 pm：σ_y ≈ 3.87 µm；PSF 3.0 µm 時量得 √(3.87² + 3²) ≈ 4.90 µm，PSF 不確定 ±0.5 µm 造成 σ_y 誤差 3×0.5/3.87 ≈ 0.39 µm（10%），ε_y 誤差約 20%。","textEn":"At a source point with β_x = 1 m, η = 5 mm, ε_x = 100 pm and σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴, σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm; ignoring the dispersion term would infer ε ≈ 110 pm, 10% high. Vertically, β_y = 3 m and ε_y = 5 pm give σ_y ≈ 3.87 µm; with a 3.0 µm PSF the measured size is √(3.87² + 3²) ≈ 4.90 µm, and a ±0.5 µm PSF uncertainty produces a σ_y error of 3×0.5/3.87 ≈ 0.39 µm (10%), about 20% in ε_y.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「束流尺寸量測與發射度反推」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion\", which statement holds?","options":["光源點 β_x = 1 m、η = 5 mm、ε_x = 100 pm、σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴：σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm。","頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。","只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。"],"optionsEn":["At a source point with β_x = 1 m, η = 5 mm, ε_x = 100 pm and σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴, σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm.","Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users.","Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"光源點 β_x = 1 m、η = 5 mm、ε_x = 100 pm、σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴：σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm；若忽略色散項，反推 ε ≈ 110 pm，高估 10%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At a source point with β_x = 1 m, η = 5 mm, ε_x = 100 pm and σδ = 6.3×10⁻⁴, σ_x = √(1×10⁻¹⁰ + (3.15×10⁻⁶)²) ≈ 10.5 µm; ignoring the dispersion term would infer ε ≈ 110 pm, 10% high. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a456-v12-19","title":"束流尺寸量測與發射度反推：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「X 光針孔相機與光源點」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “X-ray pinhole camera and source point” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在兩個 β 或 η 不同的光源點同時量測，聯立解出 ε 與 σδ；PSF 以改變針孔尺寸或用已知的小尺寸光源校正；再以斜四極調整耦合改變 ε_y，確認量到的尺寸變化與模型一致，並與 Touschek 壽命隨 ε_y 的變化交叉驗證。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure simultaneously at two source points with different β or η and solve jointly for ε and σδ; calibrate the PSF by changing pinhole size or using a known small source; then change ε_y with skew quadrupoles and confirm that the measured size change follows the model, cross-checking against the variation of Touschek lifetime with ε_y. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：針孔相機的閃爍屏或像素尺度沒有重新校正，PSF 被低估，系統回報的垂直發射度只有真實值的一半，操作人員據此判斷耦合已最小化，實際光束線的光點與同調度卻達不到預期。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the pinhole camera's scintillator or pixel scale is not recalibrated, the PSF is underestimated and the reported vertical emittance comes out half the true value; operators conclude coupling is minimized while beamline spot size and coherence fall short of expectations.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在兩個 β 或 η 不同的光源點同時量測，聯立解出 ε 與 σδ；PSF 以改變針孔尺寸或用已知的小尺寸光源校正；再以斜四極調整耦合改變 ε_y，確認量到的尺寸變化與模型一致，並與 Touschek 壽命隨 ε_y 的變化交叉驗證。","textEn":"Measure simultaneously at two source points with different β or η and solve jointly for ε and σδ; calibrate the PSF by changing pinhole size or using a known small source; then change ε_y with skew quadrupoles and confirm that the measured size change follows the model, cross-checking against the variation of Touschek lifetime with ε_y.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「束流尺寸量測與發射度反推」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","在兩個 β 或 η 不同的光源點同時量測，聯立解出 ε 與 σδ。","磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure simultaneously at two source points with different β or η and solve jointly for ε and σδ.","A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在兩個 β 或 η 不同的光源點同時量測，聯立解出 ε 與 σδ；PSF 以改變針孔尺寸或用已知的小尺寸光源校正；再以斜四極調整耦合改變 ε_y，確認量到的尺寸變化與模型一致，並與 Touschek 壽命隨 ε_y 的變化交叉驗證。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure simultaneously at two source points with different β or η and solve jointly for ε and σδ; calibrate the PSF by changing pinhole size or using a known small source; then change ε_y with skew quadrupoles and confirm that the measured size change follows the model, cross-checking against the variation of Touschek lifetime with ε_y. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a456-v12-20","title":"束流尺寸量測與發射度反推：失效診斷","titleEn":"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「X 光針孔相機與光源點」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “X-ray pinhole camera and source point” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"針孔相機的閃爍屏或像素尺度沒有重新校正，PSF 被低估，系統回報的垂直發射度只有真實值的一半，操作人員據此判斷耦合已最小化，實際光束線的光點與同調度卻達不到預期。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the pinhole camera's scintillator or pixel scale is not recalibrated, the PSF is underestimated and the reported vertical emittance comes out half the true value; operators conclude coupling is minimized while beamline spot size and coherence fall short of expectations. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：量到的是束流尺寸與儀器點擴散函數（PSF）的捲積，因此 PSF 的校正誤差會直接放大成發射度誤差，尤其當束流尺寸與 PSF 相當時。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The measured value is the beam size convolved with the instrument point-spread function (PSF), so PSF calibration error is amplified directly into emittance error, especially when beam size and PSF are comparable.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"針孔相機的閃爍屏或像素尺度沒有重新校正，PSF 被低估，系統回報的垂直發射度只有真實值的一半，操作人員據此判斷耦合已最小化，實際光束線的光點與同調度卻達不到預期。","textEn":"If the pinhole camera's scintillator or pixel scale is not recalibrated, the PSF is underestimated and the reported vertical emittance comes out half the true value; operators conclude coupling is minimized while beamline spot size and coherence fall short of expectations.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「束流尺寸量測與發射度反推」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Beam-size measurement and emittance inversion\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。","針孔相機的閃爍屏或像素尺度沒有重新校正，PSF 被低估，系統回報的垂直發射度只有真實值的一半，操作人員據此判斷耦合已最小化，實際光束線的光點與同調度卻達不到預期。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.","If the pinhole camera's scintillator or pixel scale is not recalibrated, the PSF is underestimated and the reported vertical emittance comes out half the true value."],"answer":2,"explanation":"針孔相機的閃爍屏或像素尺度沒有重新校正，PSF 被低估，系統回報的垂直發射度只有真實值的一半，操作人員據此判斷耦合已最小化，實際光束線的光點與同調度卻達不到預期。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the pinhole camera's scintillator or pixel scale is not recalibrated, the PSF is underestimated and the reported vertical emittance comes out half the true value; operators conclude coupling is minimized while beamline spot size and coherence fall short of expectations. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a456-v12-21","title":"束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「壽命監測與諧波腔」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Lifetime monitor and harmonic cavity” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"儲存電流以多種機制慢慢流失。Touschek 散射是同一束團內兩顆電子碰撞，把橫向動量轉成縱向，使能量偏差超過動量接受度而損失；束團越密（發射度越小、束團越短）損失越快，因此低發射度環的壽命往往由 Touschek 主導。殘氣散射與真空壓力成正比，新安裝的真空腔要經過數百安培小時的束流清洗，讓光子誘發脫附下降。第三諧波腔把束團拉長數倍以降低電子密度，是 MBA 環延長壽命的標準手段。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「壽命監測與諧波腔」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Stored current leaks away by several mechanisms. Touschek scattering is a collision between two electrons in the same bunch that converts transverse momentum into longitudinal, pushing the energy deviation beyond the momentum acceptance; the denser the bunch, with smaller emittance and shorter length, the faster the loss, so low-emittance rings are usually Touschek-dominated. Residual-gas scattering scales with vacuum pressure, and new chambers need hundreds of ampere-hours of beam conditioning to reduce photon-stimulated desorption. A third-harmonic cavity lengthens the bunch several times to lower electron density and is the standard way to extend lifetime in MBA rings. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Lifetime monitor and harmonic cavity”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：總壽命 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Total lifetime obeys 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas.","failure":"常見誤解：「發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「壽命監測與諧波腔」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Lifetime monitor and harmonic cavity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-21-k1","title":"束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算","titleEn":"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget","text":"儲存電流以多種機制慢慢流失。Touschek 散射是同一束團內兩顆電子碰撞，把橫向動量轉成縱向，使能量偏差超過動量接受度而損失；束團越密（發射度越小、束團越短）損失越快，因此低發射度環的壽命往往由 Touschek 主導。","textEn":"Stored current leaks away by several mechanisms. Touschek scattering is a collision between two electrons in the same bunch that converts transverse momentum into longitudinal, pushing the energy deviation beyond the momentum acceptance; the denser the bunch, with smaller emittance and shorter length, the faster the loss, so low-emittance rings are usually Touschek-dominated.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget\" is correct?","options":["儲存電流以多種機制慢慢流失。","發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。","插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。"],"optionsEn":["Stored current leaks away by several mechanisms.","Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.","An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users."],"answer":0,"explanation":"儲存電流以多種機制慢慢流失。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Stored current leaks away by several mechanisms. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a456-v12-22","title":"束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「壽命監測與諧波腔」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Lifetime monitor and harmonic cavity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：總壽命 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas。束長 10 ps 時 τ_T = 6 h（教學假設），殘氣 τ_gas = 40 h：τ ≈ 5.2 h；諧波腔拉長到 40 ps 使 τ_T（∝ σ_s）變為 24 h：τ = 1/(1/24 + 1/40) = 15 h。若晶格動量接受度從 3% 降到 2.5%，τ_T 約按接受度三次方縮為 24×0.58 ≈ 13.9 h，總壽命降到約 10.3 h。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Total lifetime obeys 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas. With a 10 ps bunch, τ_T = 6 h (teaching assumption) and τ_gas = 40 h give τ ≈ 5.2 h; a harmonic cavity stretching bunches to 40 ps raises τ_T (∝ σ_s) to 24 h and τ = 1/(1/24 + 1/40) = 15 h. If lattice momentum acceptance falls from 3% to 2.5%, τ_T shrinks roughly as the cube of acceptance to 24×0.58 ≈ 13.9 h and total lifetime to about 10.3 h. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 DCCT 量電流衰減率求壽命，並在總電流不變下改變束團填充模式（每束團電荷不同）以分離 Touschek 與殘氣項：Touschek 項隨每束團電荷變化，殘氣項只隨壓力變化；再以腔壓掃描與垂直耦合掃描確認壽命對接受度與 ε_y 的依存。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Derive lifetime from the DCCT current-decay rate, and separate Touschek and gas terms by changing the fill pattern at constant total current: the Touschek term varies with charge per bunch, the gas term only with pressure; then scan RF voltage and vertical coupling to confirm the dependence of lifetime on acceptance and ε_y.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"總壽命 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas。束長 10 ps 時 τ_T = 6 h（教學假設），殘氣 τ_gas = 40 h：τ ≈ 5.2 h；諧波腔拉長到 40 ps 使 τ_T（∝ σ_s）變為 24 h：τ = 1/(1/24 + 1/40) = 15 h。若晶格動量接受度從 3% 降到 2.5%，τ_T 約按接受度三次方縮為 24×0.58 ≈ 13.9 h，總壽命降到約 10.3 h。","textEn":"Total lifetime obeys 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas. With a 10 ps bunch, τ_T = 6 h (teaching assumption) and τ_gas = 40 h give τ ≈ 5.2 h; a harmonic cavity stretching bunches to 40 ps raises τ_T (∝ σ_s) to 24 h and τ = 1/(1/24 + 1/40) = 15 h. If lattice momentum acceptance falls from 3% to 2.5%, τ_T shrinks roughly as the cube of acceptance to 24×0.58 ≈ 13.9 h and total lifetime to about 10.3 h.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。","總壽命 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas。","磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。"],"optionsEn":["Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.","Total lifetime obeys 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas.","A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam."],"answer":1,"explanation":"總壽命 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Total lifetime obeys 1/τ = 1/τ_T + 1/τ_gas. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a456-v12-23","title":"束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「壽命監測與諧波腔」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Lifetime monitor and harmonic cavity” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 DCCT 量電流衰減率求壽命，並在總電流不變下改變束團填充模式（每束團電荷不同）以分離 Touschek 與殘氣項：Touschek 項隨每束團電荷變化，殘氣項只隨壓力變化；再以腔壓掃描與垂直耦合掃描確認壽命對接受度與 ε_y 的依存。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Derive lifetime from the DCCT current-decay rate, and separate Touschek and gas terms by changing the fill pattern at constant total current: the Touschek term varies with charge per bunch, the gas term only with pressure; then scan RF voltage and vertical coupling to confirm the dependence of lifetime on acceptance and ε_y. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：插件磁鐵或真空元件更換後未經充分束流清洗，局部壓力升高一個數量級，殘氣壽命從 40 h 掉到 4 h；散射電子同時在下游窄縫處提高輻射劑量，並帶來波盪器磁鐵永久退磁的風險。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: After replacing an insertion device or vacuum component without enough beam conditioning, local pressure rises an order of magnitude and gas lifetime drops from 40 h to 4 h, while scattered electrons raise radiation dose at downstream narrow apertures and risk permanent demagnetization of undulator magnets.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 DCCT 量電流衰減率求壽命，並在總電流不變下改變束團填充模式（每束團電荷不同）以分離 Touschek 與殘氣項：Touschek 項隨每束團電荷變化，殘氣項只隨壓力變化；再以腔壓掃描與垂直耦合掃描確認壽命對接受度與 ε_y 的依存。","textEn":"Derive lifetime from the DCCT current-decay rate, and separate Touschek and gas terms by changing the fill pattern at constant total current: the Touschek term varies with charge per bunch, the gas term only with pressure; then scan RF voltage and vertical coupling to confirm the dependence of lifetime on acceptance and ε_y.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。","以 DCCT 量電流衰減率求壽命，並在總電流不變下改變束團填充模式（每束團電荷不同）以分離 Touschek 與殘氣項：Touschek 項隨每束團電荷變化，殘氣項只隨壓力變化。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam.","Derive lifetime from the DCCT current-decay rate, and separate Touschek and gas terms by changing the fill pattern at constant total current: the Touschek term varies with charge per bunch, the gas term only with pressure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以 DCCT 量電流衰減率求壽命，並在總電流不變下改變束團填充模式（每束團電荷不同）以分離 Touschek 與殘氣項：Touschek 項隨每束團電荷變化，殘氣項只隨壓力變化；再以腔壓掃描與垂直耦合掃描確認壽命對接受度與 ε_y 的依存。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Derive lifetime from the DCCT current-decay rate, and separate Touschek and gas terms by changing the fill pattern at constant total current: the Touschek term varies with charge per bunch, the gas term only with pressure; then scan RF voltage and vertical coupling to confirm the dependence of lifetime on acceptance and ε_y. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a456-v12-24","title":"束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「壽命監測與諧波腔」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Lifetime monitor and harmonic cavity” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"插件磁鐵或真空元件更換後未經充分束流清洗，局部壓力升高一個數量級，殘氣壽命從 40 h 掉到 4 h；散射電子同時在下游窄縫處提高輻射劑量，並帶來波盪器磁鐵永久退磁的風險。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"After replacing an insertion device or vacuum component without enough beam conditioning, local pressure rises an order of magnitude and gas lifetime drops from 40 h to 4 h, while scattered electrons raise radiation dose at downstream narrow apertures and risk permanent demagnetization of undulator magnets. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：第三諧波腔把束團拉長數倍以降低電子密度，是 MBA 環延長壽命的標準手段。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A third-harmonic cavity lengthens the bunch several times to lower electron density and is the standard way to extend lifetime in MBA rings.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"插件磁鐵或真空元件更換後未經充分束流清洗，局部壓力升高一個數量級，殘氣壽命從 40 h 掉到 4 h；散射電子同時在下游窄縫處提高輻射劑量，並帶來波盪器磁鐵永久退磁的風險。","textEn":"After replacing an insertion device or vacuum component without enough beam conditioning, local pressure rises an order of magnitude and gas lifetime drops from 40 h to 4 h, while scattered electrons raise radiation dose at downstream narrow apertures and risk permanent demagnetization of undulator magnets.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「束流壽命：Touschek 散射、殘氣與誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Beam lifetime: Touschek scattering, residual gas and the error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["插件磁鐵或真空元件更換後未經充分束流清洗，局部壓力升高一個數量級，殘氣壽命從 40 h 掉到 4 h。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。"],"optionsEn":["After replacing an insertion device or vacuum component without enough beam conditioning, local pressure rises an order of magnitude and gas lifetime drops from 40 h to 4 h, while scattered electrons raise radiation dose at downstream narrow apertures and risk permanent demagnetization of undulator magnets.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users."],"answer":0,"explanation":"插件磁鐵或真空元件更換後未經充分束流清洗，局部壓力升高一個數量級，殘氣壽命從 40 h 掉到 4 h；散射電子同時在下游窄縫處提高輻射劑量，並帶來波盪器磁鐵永久退磁的風險。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"After replacing an insertion device or vacuum component without enough beam conditioning, local pressure rises an order of magnitude and gas lifetime drops from 40 h to 4 h, while scattered electrons raise radiation dose at downstream narrow apertures and risk permanent demagnetization of undulator magnets. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a456-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動」與「頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations\" and \"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a456-v12-25","title":"插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「波盪器間隙與前饋表」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Undulator gap and feedforward tables” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"儲存環的主要光源是直線段中的插件磁鐵：波盪器以週期 λu 的交錯磁場讓電子小幅蛇行，輻射在特定波長干涉增強，光子能量以間隙調整 K 值；扭擺器則以強場產生寬頻、高功率的輻射。每支插件磁鐵都是環的一部分：它增加每圈能量損失與射頻負擔，產生垂直聚焦而改變工作點，磁場積分誤差在間隙變動時擾動軌道，因此每支插件磁鐵都要附帶以間隙為索引的修正子與四極前饋表。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「波盪器間隙與前饋表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A storage ring's main sources are insertion devices in the straights: an undulator's alternating field of period λu makes electrons snake gently so radiation interferes constructively at specific wavelengths, with photon energy tuned by gap through K; a wiggler uses strong fields for broadband, high-power radiation. Each device becomes part of the ring: it adds energy loss per turn and RF load, produces vertical focusing that shifts the tune, and its field-integral errors disturb the orbit as the gap moves, so every insertion device carries gap-indexed corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Undulator gap and feedforward tables”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：λu = 2.0 cm、B₀ = 0.8 T：K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49，基頻 E₁ = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV，第 5 諧波約 10.1 keV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For λu = 2.0 cm and B0 = 0.8 T, K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49 and the fundamental E1 = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV, with the fifth harmonic near 10.1 keV.","failure":"常見誤解：「插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「波盪器間隙與前饋表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Undulator gap and feedforward tables”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-25-k1","title":"插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動","titleEn":"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations","text":"儲存環的主要光源是直線段中的插件磁鐵：波盪器以週期 λu 的交錯磁場讓電子小幅蛇行，輻射在特定波長干涉增強，光子能量以間隙調整 K 值；扭擺器則以強場產生寬頻、高功率的輻射。每支插件磁鐵都是環的一部分：它增加每圈能量損失與射頻負擔，產生垂直聚焦而改變工作點，磁場積分誤差在間隙變動時擾動軌道，因此每支插件磁鐵都要附帶以間隙為索引的修正子與四極前饋表。","textEn":"A storage ring's main sources are insertion devices in the straights: an undulator's alternating field of period λu makes electrons snake gently so radiation interferes constructively at specific wavelengths, with photon energy tuned by gap through K; a wiggler uses strong fields for broadband, high-power radiation. Each device becomes part of the ring: it adds energy loss per turn and RF load, produces vertical focusing that shifts the tune, and its field-integral errors disturb the orbit as the gap moves, so every insertion device carries gap-indexed corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations\" is correct?","options":["插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。","儲存環的主要光源是直線段中的插件磁鐵：波盪器以週期 λu 的交錯磁場讓電子小幅蛇行，輻射在特定波長干涉增強，光子能量以間隙調整 K 值。","頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。"],"optionsEn":["An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users.","A storage ring's main sources are insertion devices in the straights: an undulator's alternating field of period λu makes electrons snake gently so radiation interferes constructively at specific wavelengths, with photon energy tuned by gap through K.","Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users."],"answer":1,"explanation":"儲存環的主要光源是直線段中的插件磁鐵：波盪器以週期 λu 的交錯磁場讓電子小幅蛇行，輻射在特定波長干涉增強，光子能量以間隙調整 K 值；扭擺器則以強場產生寬頻、高功率的輻射。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A storage ring's main sources are insertion devices in the straights: an undulator's alternating field of period λu makes electrons snake gently so radiation interferes constructively at specific wavelengths, with photon energy tuned by gap through K; a wiggler uses strong fields for broadband, high-power radiation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a456-v12-26","title":"插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動：定量估算","titleEn":"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「波盪器間隙與前饋表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Undulator gap and feedforward tables” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：λu = 2.0 cm、B₀ = 0.8 T：K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49，基頻 E₁ = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV，第 5 諧波約 10.1 keV。3 m 長的能量損失 U_ID = 0.633·E²·B₀²·L ≈ 10.9 keV，500 mA 時 5.5 kW 打到前端；十支共 109 keV，加兩支 2 T、2 m 扭擺器各 45.6 keV，合計約 200 keV。垂直聚焦 k_y = 1/(2ρ₀²)，ρ₀ = 10.0/0.8 ≈ 12.5 m，β_y = 3 m 時 Δν_y = β_y·k_y·L/(4π) ≈ 0.0023。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For λu = 2.0 cm and B0 = 0.8 T, K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49 and the fundamental E1 = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV, with the fifth harmonic near 10.1 keV. A 3 m device loses U_ID = 0.633·E²·B0²·L ≈ 10.9 keV, sending 5.5 kW onto the front end at 500 mA; ten of them total 109 keV, and two 2 T, 2 m wigglers add 45.6 keV each, about 200 keV in all. Vertical focusing k_y = 1/(2ρ0²) with ρ0 = 10.0/0.8 ≈ 12.5 m gives Δν_y = β_y·k_y·L/(4π) ≈ 0.0023 for β_y = 3 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在儲存束流下逐步掃描間隙，同時記錄全環軌道、工作點與射頻功率，建立修正子與四極前饋表；驗收時要求間隙全程移動下軌道擾動小於束流尺寸的 10%，光束線則以單色器掃描諧波峰位置，確認 K 值與電子能量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Scan the gap step by step with stored beam while logging the ring-wide orbit, tunes and RF power to build corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables; acceptance requires the orbit disturbance over full gap travel to stay below 10% of the beam size, and the beamline scans harmonic peaks with its monochromator to confirm K and electron energy.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"λu = 2.0 cm、B₀ = 0.8 T：K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49，基頻 E₁ = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV，第 5 諧波約 10.1 keV。3 m 長的能量損失 U_ID = 0.633·E²·B₀²·L ≈ 10.9 keV，500 mA 時 5.5 kW 打到前端；十支共 109 keV，加兩支 2 T、2 m 扭擺器各 45.6 keV，合計約 200 keV。垂直聚焦 k_y = 1/(2ρ₀²)，ρ₀ = 10.0/0.8 ≈ 12.5 m，β_y = 3 m 時 Δν_y = β_y·k_y·L/(4π) ≈ 0.0023。","textEn":"For λu = 2.0 cm and B0 = 0.8 T, K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49 and the fundamental E1 = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV, with the fifth harmonic near 10.1 keV. A 3 m device loses U_ID = 0.633·E²·B0²·L ≈ 10.9 keV, sending 5.5 kW onto the front end at 500 mA; ten of them total 109 keV, and two 2 T, 2 m wigglers add 45.6 keV each, about 200 keV in all. Vertical focusing k_y = 1/(2ρ0²) with ρ0 = 10.0/0.8 ≈ 12.5 m gives Δν_y = β_y·k_y·L/(4π) ≈ 0.0023 for β_y = 3 m.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations\", which statement holds?","options":["只要把彎轉磁鐵做得更強，發射度就會變小。","腔壓剛好等於 U₀ 就足以維持束流。","λu = 2.0 cm、B₀ = 0.8 T：K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49，基頻 E₁ = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV，第 5 諧波約 10.1 keV。"],"optionsEn":["Making the bending magnets stronger lowers the emittance.","A cavity voltage exactly equal to U0 is enough to keep the beam.","For λu = 2.0 cm and B0 = 0.8 T, K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49 and the fundamental E1 = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV, with the fifth harmonic near 10.1 keV."],"answer":2,"explanation":"λu = 2.0 cm、B₀ = 0.8 T：K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49，基頻 E₁ = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV，第 5 諧波約 10.1 keV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For λu = 2.0 cm and B0 = 0.8 T, K = 0.934×0.8×2.0 ≈ 1.49 and the fundamental E1 = 0.950×3²/(2.0×(1 + K²/2)) ≈ 2.02 keV, with the fifth harmonic near 10.1 keV. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a456-v12-27","title":"插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「波盪器間隙與前饋表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Undulator gap and feedforward tables” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在儲存束流下逐步掃描間隙，同時記錄全環軌道、工作點與射頻功率，建立修正子與四極前饋表；驗收時要求間隙全程移動下軌道擾動小於束流尺寸的 10%，光束線則以單色器掃描諧波峰位置，確認 K 值與電子能量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Scan the gap step by step with stored beam while logging the ring-wide orbit, tunes and RF power to build corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables; acceptance requires the orbit disturbance over full gap travel to stay below 10% of the beam size, and the beamline scans harmonic peaks with its monochromator to confirm K and electron energy. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：新裝真空內波盪器的前饋表只在低電流下建立，高電流時阻抗與熱負載改變，間隙移動造成數微米的軌道跳動傳到其他光束線，使用者看到光點在別人調能量時跳動。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A new in-vacuum undulator whose feedforward table was built only at low current behaves differently at high current, where impedance and heat load change; gap moves then kick the orbit by several micrometres, and users on other beamlines see their spot jump whenever someone else changes energy.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在儲存束流下逐步掃描間隙，同時記錄全環軌道、工作點與射頻功率，建立修正子與四極前饋表；驗收時要求間隙全程移動下軌道擾動小於束流尺寸的 10%，光束線則以單色器掃描諧波峰位置，確認 K 值與電子能量。","textEn":"Scan the gap step by step with stored beam while logging the ring-wide orbit, tunes and RF power to build corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables; acceptance requires the orbit disturbance over full gap travel to stay below 10% of the beam size, and the beamline scans harmonic peaks with its monochromator to confirm K and electron energy.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations\"?","options":["在儲存束流下逐步掃描間隙，同時記錄全環軌道、工作點與射頻功率，建立修正子與四極前饋表。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。"],"optionsEn":["Scan the gap step by step with stored beam while logging the ring-wide orbit, tunes and RF power to build corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在儲存束流下逐步掃描間隙，同時記錄全環軌道、工作點與射頻功率，建立修正子與四極前饋表；驗收時要求間隙全程移動下軌道擾動小於束流尺寸的 10%，光束線則以單色器掃描諧波峰位置，確認 K 值與電子能量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Scan the gap step by step with stored beam while logging the ring-wide orbit, tunes and RF power to build corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables; acceptance requires the orbit disturbance over full gap travel to stay below 10% of the beam size, and the beamline scans harmonic peaks with its monochromator to confirm K and electron energy. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a456-v12-28","title":"插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動：失效診斷","titleEn":"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「波盪器間隙與前饋表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Undulator gap and feedforward tables” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"新裝真空內波盪器的前饋表只在低電流下建立，高電流時阻抗與熱負載改變，間隙移動造成數微米的軌道跳動傳到其他光束線，使用者看到光點在別人調能量時跳動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A new in-vacuum undulator whose feedforward table was built only at low current behaves differently at high current, where impedance and heat load change; gap moves then kick the orbit by several micrometres, and users on other beamlines see their spot jump whenever someone else changes energy. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每支插件磁鐵都是環的一部分：它增加每圈能量損失與射頻負擔，產生垂直聚焦而改變工作點，磁場積分誤差在間隙變動時擾動軌道，因此每支插件磁鐵都要附帶以間隙為索引的修正子與四極前饋表。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Each device becomes part of the ring: it adds energy loss per turn and RF load, produces vertical focusing that shifts the tune, and its field-integral errors disturb the orbit as the gap moves, so every insertion device carries gap-indexed corrector and quadrupole feedforward tables.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「插件磁鐵只影響自己的光束線，不影響其他使用者。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An insertion device affects only its own beamline, not other users.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"新裝真空內波盪器的前饋表只在低電流下建立，高電流時阻抗與熱負載改變，間隙移動造成數微米的軌道跳動傳到其他光束線，使用者看到光點在別人調能量時跳動。","textEn":"A new in-vacuum undulator whose feedforward table was built only at low current behaves differently at high current, where impedance and heat load change; gap moves then kick the orbit by several micrometres, and users on other beamlines see their spot jump whenever someone else changes energy.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「插件磁鐵整合：光子能量、環的負擔與擾動」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Insertion-device integration: photon energy, ring load and perturbations\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","新裝真空內波盪器的前饋表只在低電流下建立，高電流時阻抗與熱負載改變，間隙移動造成數微米的軌道跳動傳到其他光束線，使用者看到光點在別人調能量時跳動。","頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A new in-vacuum undulator whose feedforward table was built only at low current behaves differently at high current, where impedance and heat load change.","Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users."],"answer":1,"explanation":"新裝真空內波盪器的前饋表只在低電流下建立，高電流時阻抗與熱負載改變，間隙移動造成數微米的軌道跳動傳到其他光束線，使用者看到光點在別人調能量時跳動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A new in-vacuum undulator whose feedforward table was built only at low current behaves differently at high current, where impedance and heat load change; gap moves then kick the orbit by several micrometres, and users on other beamlines see their spot jump whenever someone else changes energy. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a456-v12-29","title":"頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「頂注注入與驗收紀錄」如何決定同步輻射儲存環的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Top-up injection and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “Synchrotron storage rings”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"現代光源以頂注運轉讓儲存電流幾乎恆定：增能環每隔幾分鐘把少量電荷注入環中，補回壽命損失，光束線的熱負載因此穩定，光學元件不必隨電流漂移重新對準。MBA 環的動態孔徑小，傳統以四支踢波磁鐵造凸軌的離軸注入很難不擾動儲存束流，因此發展出多極注入踢波器或軸上交換注入。由於注入時光束線光閘保持開啟，注入效率必須夠高，損失電荷要控制在輻射安全允許範圍內，這是頂注能否放行的核心驗收項目。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「頂注注入與驗收紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Modern light sources run in top-up mode to keep stored current nearly constant: every few minutes the booster injects a little charge to replace lifetime losses, so beamline heat loads stay steady and optics need no realignment as current drifts. MBA rings have small dynamic apertures, so classic off-axis injection with a four-kicker bump is hard to do without disturbing the stored beam, leading to multipole injection kickers or on-axis swap-out. Because beamline shutters stay open during injection, efficiency must be high and lost charge must stay within radiation-safety limits, which is the core acceptance item for allowing top-up. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Top-up injection and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：I = 500 mA、τ = 15 h：電流每小時下降 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA；要維持 ±0.5%（2.5 mA）需每 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 分鐘注入一次。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With I = 500 mA and τ = 15 h, current falls 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA per hour; holding ±0.5% (2.5 mA) requires an injection every 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 minutes.","failure":"常見誤解：「頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「頂注注入與驗收紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Top-up injection and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-29-k1","title":"頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收","titleEn":"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance","text":"現代光源以頂注運轉讓儲存電流幾乎恆定：增能環每隔幾分鐘把少量電荷注入環中，補回壽命損失，光束線的熱負載因此穩定，光學元件不必隨電流漂移重新對準。MBA 環的動態孔徑小，傳統以四支踢波磁鐵造凸軌的離軸注入很難不擾動儲存束流，因此發展出多極注入踢波器或軸上交換注入。","textEn":"Modern light sources run in top-up mode to keep stored current nearly constant: every few minutes the booster injects a little charge to replace lifetime losses, so beamline heat loads stay steady and optics need no realignment as current drifts. MBA rings have small dynamic apertures, so classic off-axis injection with a four-kicker bump is hard to do without disturbing the stored beam, leading to multipole injection kickers or on-axis swap-out.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance\" is correct?","options":["頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。","儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。","現代光源以頂注運轉讓儲存電流幾乎恆定：增能環每隔幾分鐘把少量電荷注入環中，補回壽命損失，光束線的熱負載因此穩定，光學元件不必隨電流漂移重新對準。"],"optionsEn":["Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users.","Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.","Modern light sources run in top-up mode to keep stored current nearly constant: every few minutes the booster injects a little charge to replace lifetime losses, so beamline heat loads stay steady and optics need no realignment as current drifts."],"answer":2,"explanation":"現代光源以頂注運轉讓儲存電流幾乎恆定：增能環每隔幾分鐘把少量電荷注入環中，補回壽命損失，光束線的熱負載因此穩定，光學元件不必隨電流漂移重新對準。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Modern light sources run in top-up mode to keep stored current nearly constant: every few minutes the booster injects a little charge to replace lifetime losses, so beamline heat loads stay steady and optics need no realignment as current drifts. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a456-v12-30","title":"頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收：定量估算","titleEn":"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「頂注注入與驗收紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Top-up injection and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：I = 500 mA、τ = 15 h：電流每小時下降 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA；要維持 ±0.5%（2.5 mA）需每 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 分鐘注入一次。環內 500 mA 對應 I·T₀ = 0.5×1.76 µs ≈ 0.88 µC，2.5 mA 對應 4.4 nC；注入效率 90% 時每次需送入 4.9 nC、損失 0.49 nC，每小時累積約 6.5 nC 打在環內，這個數字決定屏蔽與劑量監測的設計。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With I = 500 mA and τ = 15 h, current falls 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA per hour; holding ±0.5% (2.5 mA) requires an injection every 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 minutes. The stored 500 mA is I·T0 = 0.5×1.76 µs ≈ 0.88 µC, and 2.5 mA corresponds to 4.4 nC; at 90% efficiency each top-up must deliver 4.9 nC and loses 0.49 nC, about 6.5 nC per hour deposited in the ring, a figure that drives shielding and dose-monitoring design. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：試運轉驗收依序確認：儲存電流與壽命達標、發射度與耦合量測、軌道穩定度小於束流尺寸 10%、注入效率的統計分佈與每次注入對儲存束流的擾動（以逐圈 BPM 記錄）；再以劑量計確認損失位置與量，最後交接操作參數、前饋表與異常處理紀錄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Commissioning acceptance confirms in order: stored current and lifetime on target, measured emittance and coupling, orbit stability below 10% of beam size, the statistical distribution of injection efficiency and the disturbance of each injection on the stored beam recorded by turn-by-turn BPMs; dosimeters then confirm where and how much charge is lost, and operating parameters, feedforward tables and fault records are handed over.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"I = 500 mA、τ = 15 h：電流每小時下降 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA；要維持 ±0.5%（2.5 mA）需每 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 分鐘注入一次。環內 500 mA 對應 I·T₀ = 0.5×1.76 µs ≈ 0.88 µC，2.5 mA 對應 4.4 nC；注入效率 90% 時每次需送入 4.9 nC、損失 0.49 nC，每小時累積約 6.5 nC 打在環內，這個數字決定屏蔽與劑量監測的設計。","textEn":"With I = 500 mA and τ = 15 h, current falls 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA per hour; holding ±0.5% (2.5 mA) requires an injection every 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 minutes. The stored 500 mA is I·T0 = 0.5×1.76 µs ≈ 0.88 µC, and 2.5 mA corresponds to 4.4 nC; at 90% efficiency each top-up must deliver 4.9 nC and loses 0.49 nC, about 6.5 nC per hour deposited in the ring, a figure that drives shielding and dose-monitoring design.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance\", which statement holds?","options":["I = 500 mA、τ = 15 h：電流每小時下降 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA。","磁鐵孔徑越大越好，因為可以容納更多束流。","拍到的光點寬度就是束流尺寸，不需要扣除儀器響應。"],"optionsEn":["With I = 500 mA and τ = 15 h, current falls 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA per hour; holding ±0.5% (2.5 mA) requires an injection every 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 minutes.","A larger magnet bore is always better because it accommodates more beam.","The width of the imaged spot is the beam size, with no need to remove the instrument response."],"answer":0,"explanation":"I = 500 mA、τ = 15 h：電流每小時下降 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA；要維持 ±0.5%（2.5 mA）需每 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 分鐘注入一次。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With I = 500 mA and τ = 15 h, current falls 500/15 ≈ 33.3 mA per hour; holding ±0.5% (2.5 mA) requires an injection every 2.5/33.3 h ≈ 4.5 minutes. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a456-v12-31","title":"頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「頂注注入與驗收紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Top-up injection and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"試運轉驗收依序確認：儲存電流與壽命達標、發射度與耦合量測、軌道穩定度小於束流尺寸 10%、注入效率的統計分佈與每次注入對儲存束流的擾動（以逐圈 BPM 記錄）；再以劑量計確認損失位置與量，最後交接操作參數、前饋表與異常處理紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Commissioning acceptance confirms in order: stored current and lifetime on target, measured emittance and coupling, orbit stability below 10% of beam size, the statistical distribution of injection efficiency and the disturbance of each injection on the stored beam recorded by turn-by-turn BPMs; dosimeters then confirm where and how much charge is lost, and operating parameters, feedforward tables and fault records are handed over. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：注入踢波磁鐵的脈衝波形不匹配，每次頂注時儲存束流在數百圈內振盪數十微米；電流雖然穩定，對時間敏感的實驗卻每 4.5 分鐘出現一次壞數據。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Mismatched injection-kicker pulse shapes make the stored beam oscillate tens of micrometres for hundreds of turns at every top-up, so although current is steady, time-sensitive experiments record bad data every 4.5 minutes; if injection efficiency slowly falls unnoticed, the growing lost charge trips radiation interlocks and stops top-up.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"試運轉驗收依序確認：儲存電流與壽命達標、發射度與耦合量測、軌道穩定度小於束流尺寸 10%、注入效率的統計分佈與每次注入對儲存束流的擾動（以逐圈 BPM 記錄）；再以劑量計確認損失位置與量，最後交接操作參數、前饋表與異常處理紀錄。","textEn":"Commissioning acceptance confirms in order: stored current and lifetime on target, measured emittance and coupling, orbit stability below 10% of beam size, the statistical distribution of injection efficiency and the disturbance of each injection on the stored beam recorded by turn-by-turn BPMs; dosimeters then confirm where and how much charge is lost, and operating parameters, feedforward tables and fault records are handed over.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","試運轉驗收依序確認：儲存電流與壽命達標、發射度與耦合量測、軌道穩定度小於束流尺寸 10%、注入效率的統計分佈與每次注入對儲存束流的擾動（以逐圈 BPM 記錄）。","發射度越低，束流壽命一定越長。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Commissioning acceptance confirms in order: stored current and lifetime on target, measured emittance and coupling, orbit stability below 10% of beam size, the statistical distribution of injection efficiency and the disturbance of each injection on the stored beam recorded by turn-by-turn BPMs.","Lower emittance always gives longer beam lifetime."],"answer":1,"explanation":"試運轉驗收依序確認：儲存電流與壽命達標、發射度與耦合量測、軌道穩定度小於束流尺寸 10%、注入效率的統計分佈與每次注入對儲存束流的擾動（以逐圈 BPM 記錄）；再以劑量計確認損失位置與量，最後交接操作參數、前饋表與異常處理紀錄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Commissioning acceptance confirms in order: stored current and lifetime on target, measured emittance and coupling, orbit stability below 10% of beam size, the statistical distribution of injection efficiency and the disturbance of each injection on the stored beam recorded by turn-by-turn BPMs; dosimeters then confirm where and how much charge is lost, and operating parameters, feedforward tables and fault records are handed over. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a456-v12-32","title":"頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收：失效診斷","titleEn":"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"prerequisiteIds":["a456-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「頂注注入與驗收紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Top-up injection and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"注入踢波磁鐵的脈衝波形不匹配，每次頂注時儲存束流在數百圈內振盪數十微米；電流雖然穩定，對時間敏感的實驗卻每 4.5 分鐘出現一次壞數據。若注入效率逐漸下降而未察覺，損失電荷增加會觸發輻射連鎖，使頂注中止。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Mismatched injection-kicker pulse shapes make the stored beam oscillate tens of micrometres for hundreds of turns at every top-up, so although current is steady, time-sensitive experiments record bad data every 4.5 minutes; if injection efficiency slowly falls unnoticed, the growing lost charge trips radiation interlocks and stops top-up. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：由於注入時光束線光閘保持開啟，注入效率必須夠高，損失電荷要控制在輻射安全允許範圍內，這是頂注能否放行的核心驗收項目。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because beamline shutters stay open during injection, efficiency must be high and lost charge must stay within radiation-safety limits, which is the core acceptance item for allowing top-up.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「頂注只是讓電流穩定，對光束線使用者沒有其他影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Top-up merely keeps the current steady and has no other effect on beamline users.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a456-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"注入踢波磁鐵的脈衝波形不匹配，每次頂注時儲存束流在數百圈內振盪數十微米；電流雖然穩定，對時間敏感的實驗卻每 4.5 分鐘出現一次壞數據。若注入效率逐漸下降而未察覺，損失電荷增加會觸發輻射連鎖，使頂注中止。","textEn":"Mismatched injection-kicker pulse shapes make the stored beam oscillate tens of micrometres for hundreds of turns at every top-up, so although current is steady, time-sensitive experiments record bad data every 4.5 minutes; if injection efficiency slowly falls unnoticed, the growing lost charge trips radiation interlocks and stops top-up.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]},{"id":"a456-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「頂注運轉、注入效率與試運轉驗收」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Top-up operation, injection efficiency and commissioning acceptance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","儲存環的電子以固定能量循環，不需要持續補充能量。","注入踢波磁鐵的脈衝波形不匹配，每次頂注時儲存束流在數百圈內振盪數十微米；電流雖然穩定，對時間敏感的實驗卻每 4.5 分鐘出現一次壞數據。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Stored electrons circulate at fixed energy and need no continuous energy input.","Mismatched injection-kicker pulse shapes make the stored beam oscillate tens of micrometres for hundreds of turns at every top-up, so although current is steady, time-sensitive experiments record bad data every 4.5 minutes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"注入踢波磁鐵的脈衝波形不匹配，每次頂注時儲存束流在數百圈內振盪數十微米；電流雖然穩定，對時間敏感的實驗卻每 4.5 分鐘出現一次壞數據。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Mismatched injection-kicker pulse shapes make the stored beam oscillate tens of micrometres for hundreds of turns at every top-up, so although current is steady, time-sensitive experiments record bad data every 4.5 minutes; if injection efficiency slowly falls unnoticed, the growing lost charge trips radiation interlocks and stops top-up. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-nsrrc-tps-overview","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-diamond-how-it-works","v6-science-lhc-rf"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
